  {
   "id": "fmgQoxfcAgAJ",
   "from": "Joe Cheng",
   "author": "ca443e6eaa0e78ed",
   "date": "2016-07-21T23:00:11Z",
   "subject": "Re: Dynamically Updating CSS for UI elements",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I wouldn&#39;t do it this way. Instead, have your UI do this:<div><br></div><div>plotOutput(&quot;allmaps&quot;, height = &quot;auto&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>And then in server.R:</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div>output$allmaps &lt;- renderPlot(</div><div>  {</div><div>    do.call(&quot;grid.arrange&quot;, c(plotObjects(), nrow = ceiling(getTotal() / getNumCols()), ncol = getNumCols()))</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"line-height:1.5\">  },</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:1.5\">  height = function() {</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:1.5\">    100 * getTotal()</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:1.5\">  }</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:1.5\">)</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:1.5\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:1.5\">Ohhhh. I just realized that you&#39;re using &quot;vh&quot; units, and the above only works with pixels.</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:1.5\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:1.5\">OK. Using your original code you can probably do this:</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:1.5\"><br></span></div><div><div>       $(&#39;#allmaps&#39;).css(&#39;height&#39;, message).trigger(&#39;shown&#39;);</div><div style=\"line-height:1.5\"><br></div></div><div style=\"line-height:1.5\">The trigger(&#39;shown&#39;) at the end is to cause Shiny to realize that something has happened that might have affected the layout of the page, so it will take the time to re-examine the visibility and size of all output elements and send any changed properties to the server.</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Thu, Jul 21, 2016 at 3:12 PM &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">df...@princeton.edu</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
